<title>USA: Exigent names Smedley chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Exigent names Smedley chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE, Fla. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exigent International Inc said Monday it named Bernie Smedley, formerly of private AirNet Communications Corp, chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>&quot;The position was created as a result of the company going public in January,&quot; said Smedley, adding the company restructured its operations at that time.</p>
